      "content": "That feeling of life feeling like a painful routine with no inherent meaning is deeply overwhelming, and it is completely understandable that you feel exhausted. Please be gentle with yourself as you navigate this profound sense of aimlessness and pain. If the despair feels too heavy to carry alone, please consider connecting with a crisis support service immediately to talk to someone who can help you through this exhaustion.",
