      "content": "I want you to know that the pain of feeling this intense struggle while wishing for the peace you feel he has is a deeply painful part of grief. Please do not feel you have to carry this unbearable weight alone, as help is available right now. If you are in crisis, please call or text 988 in the US to connect with a suicide and crisis life line immediately.",
